---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | RiddlesMaster"
  description="Read the Terms and Conditions of service for the RiddlesMaster technical interview preparation platform."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-[#141413] max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#141413] font-serif mb-6 leading-tight"
      >
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-[#6c6a64] italic mb-8">
        Last Updated: June 10, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed text-[15px]">
        <p>
          Welcome to RiddlesMaster. By accessing or using our platform, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions of service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          1. Service Description
        </h2>
        <p>
          RiddlesMaster provides curated puzzles, logic riddles, editorial guides, and workspace environments designed to help software engineers and analysts prepare for technical interviews.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          2. Account Creation Requirements
        </h2>
        <p>
          To access certain features of the platform, you must create a user account. You agree to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Provide a valid and active email address during signup.</li>
          <li>Limit yourself to exactly one (1) account per person. Creating multiple accounts to bypass puzzle limits or exploit promotions is strictly prohibited.</li>
          <li>Maintain the confidentiality of your credentials.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          3. Subscription and Billing Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          RiddlesMaster offers premium plans to unlock full solutions and specialized tracks:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Pricing:</strong> All subscription prices are denominated in Indian Rupees (INR).</li>
          <li><strong>No Auto-Renewal:</strong> Our premium subscriptions are manual one-time purchases and do not support auto-renewal. Subscriptions will auto-expire at the end of the duration, and you must manually repurchase to extend access.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          4. Refund Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          Due to the digital nature of our platform's content and the immediate unlocking of premium resources, all purchases are final. We offer <strong>no refunds</strong> on active or expired digital subscriptions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          5. Acceptable Use
        </h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this platform only for personal, non-commercial purposes. Sharing account access with third parties is prohibited. Additionally, you must not:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Use scraping tools, automated scripts, or web crawlers to copy puzzles or answers from the platform.</li>
          <li>Abuse our servers, conduct penetration tests without authorization, or exploit any database constraints.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          6. Termination
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to suspend, limit, or terminate your access to the platform at our sole discretion, without notice, if we detect violation of these Terms, scraping activity, or abusive behavior.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-[#e6dfd8] pb-2">
          7. Governing Law
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms & Conditions shall be governed by, construed, and enforced in accordance with the laws of <strong>India</strong>. Any disputes arising from the use of our services will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in India.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
